Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 04:06:26 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 01/33] HC read on gfx1100: pipelined staged down
 (STRATA_GR_PIPE) and the read in one kernel (STRATA_GR_ONE)

Port of opt7/integrate 432ff3be 4078a4f3 8f3ced2a 50c6c675 210ebbdd onto v0.2.9.
- gr_down_pipe_kernel: the staged down projection with LDS-only barriers and pipelined loads, on by default on
  gfx1100 (STRATA_GR_PIPE=0/1 forces it); same sums in the same order as gr_down_staged_kernel.
- gr_one_kernel: norm, pipelined down and q32 up of a 1-6 token read in one launch (roles by block, counters),
  default on where the pipe runs (STRATA_GR_ONE=0: three kernels). fused_gr_check runs it bit for bit against the
  plain read at start and turns it off if it differs or a wait times out; generate/serve stop if a wait times out.
- Not with v0.2.9's int8 HC weights (STRATA_HC_REQ8: s_down set) or sm_75 token groups (HIP has none).
- Dropped STRATA_GR_DOWN_WARPS (9f78384c): measured no faster.
Measured on 0.1.43: pipe code +6.5%, edit +8.9%; one kernel read 1.16-1.40x at 1-6 tokens, decode +1.5-2.5%.
